o not choose blindly. Use Debirun's special ability, \u201cEvil Eye Search,\u201d to look into your opponent's mind. By reading their thoughts, you will naturally find the correct answer, or you may even catch a glimpse of an unexpected side of them...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/ab98069838e1ed13c2cf2412ea4d6330.poster.avif?t=1754279865\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/ab98069838e1ed13c2cf2412ea4d6330.webm?t=1754279865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/ab98069838e1ed13c2cf2412ea4d6330.mp4?t=1754279865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most important feature of this game is the large number of endings. The wrong choice can result in an immediate ending... Use the magic of save and load to explore all possibilities and find the true ending to this story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know it's a bad choice, but you can't help but want to see how they react in order to collect the ending... Is it OK to do this? This is a story about doing \u201cimmoral things\u201d with the devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/fbce906c521c429a0cd74d81679fd7b4.poster.avif?t=1754279865\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/fbce906c521c429a0cd74d81679fd7b4.webm?t=1754279865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054820/extras/fbce906c521c429a0cd74d81679fd7b4.mp4?t=1754